2026-10-13T11:14:29.5507428Z Run the POSIX AIO store benchmark.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5507596Z 
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5507678Z options:
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5508181Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5508521Z   -w WORKER_NUMBER, --worker-number WORKER_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5508868Z                         worker number: number of worker processes to start
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5509192Z                         concurrently.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5509949Z   -s SHARD_SIZE, --shard-size SHARD_SIZE
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5510280Z                         shard size: POSIX store I/O size. In layerwise mode,
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5510657Z                         this is the K/V tensor size for one layer of one
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5511036Z                         block. In non-layerwise mode, this is the K/V tensor
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5511384Z                         size for all layers of one block.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5511694Z   -n SHARD_NUMBER, --shard-number SHARD_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5512039Z                         shard number: number of layers in layerwise mode; use
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5512382Z                         1 in non-layerwise mode.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5512828Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5513157Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5513509Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5513873Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5514469Z   -l LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER, --load-epoch-number LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5514829Z                         load epoch number: number of load epochs.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5515174Z   -o STORAGE_BACKEND, --storage-backend STORAGE_BACKEND
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5515521Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5515862Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5516178Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5516589Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5516979Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5517322Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5517664Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5518179Z                         for GQA.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5518415Z   --input-len INPUT_LEN
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5518696Z                         request input length; block_number = ceil(input_len /
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5519024Z                         block_size).
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5519269Z   --layerwise, --no-layerwise
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5519567Z                         layerwise mode: one shard = one layer (default true;
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5519953Z                         --no-layerwise for non-layerwise, one shard = all
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5520269Z                         layers).
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5520494Z   --block-size BLOCK_SIZE
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5520767Z                         vLLM paged block size in tokens; used to derive
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5521100Z                         block_number from input-len.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5521471Z   --kv-dtype KV_DTYPE   override KV dtype: bfloat16/bf16, float16/fp16,
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5521871Z                         float32/fp32, float8_e4m3fn/fp8, float8_e5m2, int8.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5522235Z                         Default: config torch_dtype or bfloat16.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5522608Z   --posix-data-trans-concurrency POSIX_DATA_TRANS_CONCURRENCY
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5523014Z                         posix data transfer concurrency (psync worker count).
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5523346Z                         Default 32.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5523594Z   --posix-io-engine {psync,aio}
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5523879Z                         posix io engine: psync or aio. Default aio.
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5524183Z   --io-direct, --no-io-direct
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5524503Z                         use O_DIRECT for aligned file I/O (default true; --no-
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5524848Z                         io-direct to disable).
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5525201Z   --dry-run             print the computed profile and the forwarded command
2026-10-13T11:14:29.5525568Z                         without launching the script.
