2026-10-13T11:14:29.6532382Z   --engines LIST        comma-separated IO engines, subset of 'psync,aio'
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6532741Z                         (default psync)
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6533075Z   --modes LIST          comma-separated phases to run per combo: subset of
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6533478Z                         'dump,read,mix' (default all; mix = read-heavy
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6533791Z                         1:rw_ratio)
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6534134Z   --threshold GB        minimum best aggregate bandwidth in GB/s (default 8.0)
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6534532Z   --block-number N      blocks per dump/load sweep
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6534848Z   --dump-epochs N       dump sweeps per combo
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6535146Z   --load-epochs N       load sweeps per combo
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6535520Z   --mixed-epochs N      read-heavy mixed sweeps per combo (1 dump + rw_ratio
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6535878Z                         loads each)
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6536199Z   --rw-ratio N          reads per write in the mixed phase (read-heavy; 0
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6536564Z                         disables mixed, default 4)
2026-10-13T11:14:29.6536900Z   --quick               halve dump/load/mixed epochs for a faster run
